{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"fa10021db581bdb7dc44e84953842ac9ccb34009","node_id":"C_kwDOAQzde9oAKGZhMTAwMjFkYjU4MWJkYjdkYzQ0ZTg0OTUzODQyYWM5Y2NiMzQwMDk","commit":{"author":{"name":"David Emmerson","email":"68339477+gearsetdave@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-17T14:20:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-17T14:20:29Z"},"message":"Fix race in ModelMetadata.GetHashCode (#69888)\n\n* Fix race in ModelMetadata.GetHashCode\n\nThe hash was cached in an unsynchronized int?, so a concurrent caller\ncould see HasValue set before the value was written and get 0 back.\nWhen that happens while the record constructor parameter mapping is\nbuilt, the parameter is stored under hash 0 and every later lookup\nmisses, failing validation for that record until the process restarts.\n\nCache the hash in a plain int with 0 meaning not yet computed, read once\ninto a local. An aligned int is read and written atomically, so a reader\nsees either 0 and computes the hash itself, or the real value.\n\nFixes #59384\n\n* Compute ModelMetadataIdentity hash code in the constructor\n\nModelMetadataIdentity is immutable, so it can compute its hash once in\nthe constructor and keep it in a readonly field. ModelMetadata then\nreturns Identity.GetHashCode() directly, which replaces the int cache\nfrom the previous commit. With no cache left in ModelMetadata,\nGetHashCode can no longer return 0 under a race.","tree":{"sha":"2a3b30e0470ec81f0691400d46e785a05cd4196b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/git/trees/2a3b30e0470ec81f0691400d46e785a05cd4196b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/git/commits/fa10021db581bdb7dc44e84953842ac9ccb34009","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq/GKtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWFAQAIevJpQB1CP1bFsNVgKllOMH\nnzN+ct8uhaef696qv6EVFMeThCfy7quQDAy8iLmBkeiIR7IczgbZFAnzu6gxnhWc\nWhQQfSZlereDEpj3FFjgggBfvpiyqC1PjmB4/TPT8n1sxs09pNhqMu0COBubEMTe\nDa+8rI0qVCSz2v1qmxxJCILwnOSG4U1lwwzt9rGdQjHnwAsoApDNBcqbiJ4j/dFZ\njCA/wsXsQBfjSulM5ue+neC7wXMqxk+wZO0MyBONwoTlwHDYCZaL50W9BV9Tb8de\nDQjaqvz8DdMqhL/si6CSItmpuWGIswmhxFgf3BgeScS/ezrcUnwmVpZGxsT5Jd2n\nXdEMbS/HsCajR5DrwctCMzi1spayABgJrtdBt35w4aD08dJoCUJilCtYu5VNMUop\n7+EL9aTBDJZhZ5g/B/kKzG35erQIoWuO0pDlsm+vQLdqH1ua5eZSA2HDoR4V2nbL\nhZ9LgOWjwNiug+LJSQkLvy2pkmp8UYcOEPlnaMJeCRhcYskOK+LFbf0/pzIJ/aEE\no0nhKz5Mzlax1Mj1ZioLd9LPoc1Mhd/zBOxgk7am0uRH99DQPLwXTE9bhj2Gwfg+\nnCZC27FqB88YcOfY4cKuP1vjk6Y55f8mdAwtwPusBiAHWh68sL16vvNCAU56uccC\nAUqgRklC3OOlldZdKKVy\n=oI/H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 2a3b30e0470ec81f0691400d46e785a05cd4196b\nparent 49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f\nauthor David Emmerson <68339477+gearsetdave@users.noreply.github.com> 1794925229 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1794925229 +0100\n\nFix race in ModelMetadata.GetHashCode (#69888)\n\n* Fix race in ModelMetadata.GetHashCode\n\nThe hash was cached in an unsynchronized int?, so a concurrent caller\ncould see HasValue set before the value was written and get 0 back.\nWhen that happens while the record constructor parameter mapping is\nbuilt, the parameter is stored under hash 0 and every later lookup\nmisses, failing validation for that record until the process restarts.\n\nCache the hash in a plain int with 0 meaning not yet computed, read once\ninto a local. An aligned int is read and written atomically, so a reader\nsees either 0 and computes the hash itself, or the real value.\n\nFixes #59384\n\n* Compute ModelMetadataIdentity hash code in the constructor\n\nModelMetadataIdentity is immutable, so it can compute its hash once in\nthe constructor and keep it in a readonly field. ModelMetadata then\nreturns Identity.GetHashCode() directly, which replaces the int cache\nfrom the previous commit. With no cache left in ModelMetadata,\nGetHashCode can no longer return 0 under a race.","verified_at":"2026-11-17T14:20:30Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/fa10021db581bdb7dc44e84953842ac9ccb34009","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/commit/fa10021db581bdb7dc44e84953842ac9ccb34009","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/fa10021db581bdb7dc44e84953842ac9ccb34009/comments","author":{"login":"gearsetdave","id":68339477,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MzM5NDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68339477?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave","html_url":"https://github.com/gearsetdave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gearsetdave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/commits/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/commit/49147673007a4b1d676694e2c5f85b83ad76c36f"}]},"_links":{"self":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/branches/main","html":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/tree/main"},"protected":true,"protection":{"enabled":true,"required_status_checks":{"enforcement_level":"non_admins","contexts":["license/cla","Build Analysis"],"checks":[{"context":"license/cla","app_id":null},{"context":"Build Analysis","app_id":216604}]}},"protection_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/branches/main/protection"}